+# T01 质量基线与执行命令
+
+工作目录：本文件所在目录。版本锁定值见 `environment.json`；未安装新依赖。
+
+| 检查 | 精确命令 | 范围 / 完成规则 |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| 单元 / 反例 | `python3 -B -m unittest discover -s . -p 'test_*.py' -v` | 144 项用例（inventory 17 + target_guard 17 + contract 20 + migrations 10 + staging 15 + adapters 12 + assets 13 + ocr 10 + yinzhi 10 + importer 12 + projection 7，含 CLI 反例、冻结 golden/fixture 对比、真实 PG 迁移/幂等导入/投影用例、并发与断连恢复、双语互链与 20 张海报提取）全部通过 |
+| lint | `ruff check inventory.py test_inventory.py target_guard.py test_target_guard.py contract.py test_contract.py generate_golden.py pg_candidate.py run_migrations.py test_migrations.py stage_validator.py test_stage_validator.py generate_t08_fixtures.py adapters.py test_adapters.py generate_t04_samples.py run_t04_pilot.py asset_registry.py test_asset_registry.py ocr_extract.py test_ocr_extract.py yinzhi_segment.py test_yinzhi_segment.py generate_t07_golden.py importer.py test_importer.py projection.py test_projection.py` | 二十八个模块零违规 |
+| format | `ruff format --check inventory.py test_inventory.py target_guard.py test_target_guard.py contract.py test_contract.py generate_golden.py pg_candidate.py run_migrations.py test_migrations.py stage_validator.py test_stage_validator.py generate_t08_fixtures.py adapters.py test_adapters.py generate_t04_samples.py run_t04_pilot.py asset_registry.py test_asset_registry.py ocr_extract.py test_ocr_extract.py yinzhi_segment.py test_yinzhi_segment.py generate_t07_golden.py importer.py test_importer.py projection.py test_projection.py` | 二十八个模块均通过 |
+| typecheck | `pyright --project pyrightconfig.json` | 零 error |
+| 候选集群管理 | `python3 -B pg_candidate.py init` / `status` / `stop` / `destroy` | 仅 TCP 127.0.0.1:55441；数据目录 candidate_pg/（归属标记 T03）；旧端点 /tmp:55432 永不连接 |
+| 候选库迁移 | `python3 -B run_migrations.py --database <db> --dry-run`（只读） / `--apply`（应用） | 默认迁移目录 migrations/；台账+checksum；重复执行 no-op；checksum 冲突 exit 2；失败整体回滚 |
+| 候选目标预检（T01-R3，真实目标） | `python3 -B target_guard.py --policy target_policy.json --target candidate_data --dry-run` | `target_ok` 且 `empty: true`（或带有效归属标记）；试点建库前必须重跑 |
+
+后续 adapter-fixture、projection-query、recovery-e2e 尚无实现，状态 NOT_RUN；由各任务补齐真实命令，不把本单元测试命令冒充全套检查。
+
